# Managed by the NetOps host playbook.
# Ciphers, MACs, KEX, PAM, banner, idle timeout, X11 and user environment are set by the STIG remediation
# (00-complianceascode-*.conf, read first); this file holds what the STIG leaves open.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AuthenticationMethods publickey
AllowUsers {{ admin_user }}
IgnoreRhosts yes
HostbasedAuthentication no

LoginGraceTime 60
MaxAuthTries 4
MaxSessions 4
MaxStartups 10:30:60

AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
GatewayPorts no

LogLevel VERBOSE
